      "title": "Sermon on the Mount - Beatitudes",
      "reference": "Matthew 5:1-12",
      "content": "The Beatitudes describe the character of citizens of God's kingdom. Counterintuitive by worldly standards - the poor in spirit, mourning, and meek are declared blessed. Kingdom values invert cultural expectations.",
